---
description: Persistent AI team coordination rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` and `collaboration/AI_TEAM_PROTOCOL.md` before material work.

Cursor is Lead Engineering Agent. ChatGPT/JARVIS is Systems Architect / Chief of Staff. The human owner retains final authority over strategic or irreversible actions.

Canonical branch: `main`.
Working lanes: `agent/cursor`, `agent/chatgpt`.
Substantial isolated work: `work/<agent>/<task-id>-<slug>`.

Never silently overwrite another agent's material changes.
Do not push directly to `main` unless explicitly authorized for bootstrap/admin work.
Use Issues for handoffs and PRs for integration/review.
After material work: test, commit, push, document verification, then re-sync from `main` after merges.

Repository-specific instructions and privacy/security rules take precedence.
